title: 共产党提出了它对联盟的目标清单。
view-if: (in_popular_front = 1 or in_left_front = 1) and kpd_goals_seen = 0 and kpd_coalition_success = 0 and next_election_time - time > 12 and spd_in_government
on-arrival: kpd_goals_seen = 1; welfare_goal = 0; agriculture_goal = 0; economy_goal = 0; finance_goal = 0; labor_goal = 0; reichswehr_goal = 0; welfare_goal = 1; foreign_goal = 0; agriculture_goal = 1 if agriculture_minister_party != "KPD" and land_reform < 3; economy_goal = 1 if economy_minister_party != "KPD" and not capital_flight; finance_goal = 1 if finance_minister_party != "KPD"; labor_goal = 1 if labor_minister_party != "KPD"; reichswehr_goal = 1 if reichswehr_minister_party != "KPD" and reichswehr_strength >= 20; kpd_ultimatum_timer = 12; kpd_ultimatum_timer = 16 if kpd_relation >= 60; kpd_ultimatum_timer = 24 if kpd_party_leader == "Conciliators" or constructive_vonc; kpd_ultimatum_timer = next_election_time - time - 1 if next_election_time - time <= 12;
new-page: true
tags: event

= 共产党的目标

共产党向我们提交了一份联盟目标清单:

[? if welfare_goal = 1 : - 扩大社会福利计划。 ?]

[? if agriculture_goal = 1 : - 推行土地改革计划。 ?]

[? if economy_goal = 1 : - 着手对经济进行大规模国有化。 ?]

[? if finance_goal = 1 : - 让税制更具累进性。 ?]

[? if labor_goal = 1 : - 在劳资纠纷中支持工人。 ?]

[? if foreign_goal = 1 : - 改善我们与苏联的关系。 ?]

#[? if interior_goal = 1 : - Ban the SA and Stahlhelm. ?]

[? if reichswehr_goal = 1 : - 削减国防军的经费。 ?]

他们说,期望在 [+ kpd_ultimatum_timer +] 个月内看到这些目标实现。否则,他们将投票解散联盟。
